1c:["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：XFLTD（中文名养鸡场）是一家 2021 年 11 月开张、到现在四年九个月的老"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"机场"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":"。搜它最常撞到两件事，本文把两件都核完了："}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"第一，那条广为流传的「xfltd跑路」举报是误报"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":"——GitHub 跑路名单里那条 issue 由用户在 2024 年 11 月 2 日提交，25 天后"}],["$","$1","6",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"发帖人自己回复「是我用错软件了，还可以用」"}]}],["$","$1","7",{"children":"，至今没被收进跑路名单正文。"}],["$","$1","8",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"第二，「打不开」是真的，但原因是入口不是跑路"}]}],["$","$1","9",{"children":"：官方前后列过九个官网与发布页，实测 "}],["$","$1","10",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"www.xfltd.org"}]}],["$","$1","11",{"children":" 及跳向它的五个域名国内可直连，my.xfltd.org 和 xf.kg 已被 DNS 污染需挂代理，dash.xf.kg 无解析；"}],["$","$1","12",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"最讽刺的是面板首页那条《防丢失域名》公告让你收藏三个域名保命，其中养鸡场.top 和养鸡场.cc 实测已经完全没有解析记录"}]}],["$","$1","13",{"children":"。判断它死没死别看 TG 频道（最后一条停在 7 月 4 日，44 天没动），"}],["$","$1","14",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"要看官网教程页——iOS 教程最后更新就是核实当天"}]}],["$","$1","15",{"children":"，用户群两万一千人还有三百多在线。价格一手读到七档：包月 7/14/20 元给 150G/300G/500G，"}],["$","$1","16",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"季付半年付全部零折扣，年付三档折扣却不一样——500G 省两个月、150G 省一个月、300G 一分钱不省"}]}],["$","$1","17",{"children":"；四档不限时流量包每 GB 0.174 到 0.2 元，是包月档的四到五倍，还把线路降成「普通直连」、IP 数从 10 减到 5、SLA 从 99.9% 变成没有。"}],["$","$1","18",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"最该警惕的是官方自己 5 月 8 日说的"}]}],["$","$1","19",{"children":"：国内中转入口被通报清退、已损失两万元，"}],["$","$1","20",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"上游正在考虑是否清退他们的全部业务"}]}],["$","$1","21",{"children":"。买法："}],["$","$1","22",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"只买 500G 年付或 150G 月付，别碰不限时档，别压 300G 的年付"}]}],["$","$1","23",{"children":"。"}]]}],"\n"]}]
